#: ../../reference/config-schema.md:298
msgid "Requiring two signals is what keeps real misspellings visible. `Hoare` is suppressed because it is a known surname *and* capitalized mid-sentence; `thier` is not, because it is lowercase and sits one edit from `their`. Raising `aggressiveness` lowers that bar and will eventually cost you real typos."
msgstr "Requiring two signals is what keeps real misspellings visible. `Hoare` is suppressed because it is a known surname *and* capitalized mid-sentence; `thier` is not, because it is lowercase and sits one edit from `their`. Raising `aggressiveness` lowers that bar and will eventually cost you real typos."

